==================================================  
PAYMENT GATEWAY  
==================================================  
  
Use Razorpay architecture for Indian payments.  
  
IMPORTANT SECURITY RULE:  
  
NEVER expose the Razorpay secret key in client-side code.  
  
Use:  
  
NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID  
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET  
  
Create server-side API route for creating Razorpay orders.  
  
Suggested architecture:  
  
/api/payment/create-order  
  
/api/payment/verify  
  
Flow:  
  
10. Customer clicks Pay  
11. Frontend sends cart/order information to server  
12. Server creates Razorpay order  
13. Razorpay checkout opens  
14. Customer completes payment  
15. Server verifies Razorpay signature  
16. Order becomes Paid  
17. Show order confirmation  
  
Do NOT fake payment success.  
  
If Razorpay credentials are not available, implement the architecture with environment variables and clearly indicate what needs configuration.  
  
